This isn't a bug at all, and it isn't a mistake; it's brilliant.  If you trouble
to read the "Elric" books from which the Black Sword Stormbringer is taken, you
will find that this is *exactly* true -- the blade would force Elric to slay his
kin, friends, lovers, etc., even leaping into his hand to do so on occasion; and
he *could*not* get rid of it.  (Nymphs, etc., should be unable to steal Stormy.)

Arguably it should be intrinsically rustproof *and* unenchantable, but come with
a decent plus to begin with -- because in a sense it wasn't a sword at all but a
demon in sword shape.



